    "P1": "Four sources give genuine final eight-state membership iff four actual odd gates, same-history owner/parent and actual product(1/(p-1)) weighted omission uniformly at one threshold. Only bounded blue child; Y05/P1.4 remain yellow for signed physical reserve and kernel acceptance.",
    "PP": "Nine new sources and one explicit API variant. Select high-remainder-next/api/P4BOriginalRankTwoGlobalPayment.lean for callers of its two new generic BV entries; retain all three original public types. All-rank actual .4 moduli payment and same-rho high signed mother modes reduce to finite-band analytic duty, with 38+1 logarithmic cost. Live fibres restricted only after inverse Fourier integration. Low-first, collisions, absolute 7/32 and no-medium remain.",
    "P3": "Eight sources identify actual all-cusp M/N marked weak Hilbert coordinates a.e., with 1/(4pi), and absolute full-line covariance equal to inner N(nativeSynthesis(analysis M)). Equality to continuous-spectrum orthogonal projection and full Plancherel/Kuznetsov/7/32 remain. Inherited source/API staging holds remain explicit.",
    "CI": "No new dispatch. Stored020-030 run43153562459 currently kernel step; P2r2 run43157098719 pending preserved. Fine ca9 local prepared only; old Stored originals differ from accepted chunked postimages, so selection must be corrected before any dispatch."
